"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-shared]]`link:#quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-shared[quarkus.redis.devservices.shared]`\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Indicates if the Redis server managed by Quarkus Dev Services is shared. When shared, Quarkus looks for running containers using label-based service discovery. If a matching container is found, it is used, and so a second one is not started. Otherwise, Dev Services for Redis starts a new container.\n"
"\n"
"The discovery uses the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label. The value is configured using the `service-name` property.\n"
"\n"
"Container sharing is only used in dev mode.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_REDIS_DEVSERVICES_SHARED+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid "icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-shared]]`link:#quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-shared[quarkus.redis.devservices.shared]`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Indicates if the Redis server managed by Quarkus Dev Services is shared. When shared, Quarkus looks for running containers using label-based service discovery. If a matching container is found, it is used, and so a second one is not started. Otherwise, Dev Services for Redis starts a new container."
msgstr ""

msgid "The discovery uses the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label. The value is configured using the `service-name` property."
msgstr ""

msgid "Container sharing is only used in dev mode."
msgstr ""

msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_REDIS_DEVSERVICES_SHARED+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-service-name]]`link:#quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-service-name[quarkus.redis.devservices.service-name]`\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label attached to the started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for Redis looks for a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label set to the configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label set to the specified value.\n"
"\n"
"This property is used when you need multiple shared Redis servers.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_REDIS_DEVSERVICES_SERVICE_NAME+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid "icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-service-name]]`link:#quarkus-redis-client-config-group-dev-services-config_quarkus-redis-devservices-service-name[quarkus.redis.devservices.service-name]`"
msgstr ""

msgid "The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label attached to the started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for Redis looks for a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label set to the configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-redis` label set to the specified value."
